{"id":"n61179-1-9","stage":1,"title":"바뀌다 · 被换","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61179-1-9-1","ko":"오랜만에 왔는데 카페 종업원이 바뀌었네요.","zh":"好久没来了，咖啡店的员工换人了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"왔는데","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔는데","audio":"/audio/00521fca05afdb9d28ff.mp3"}},{"text":"카페","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","explanation":"카페：咖啡店，咖啡馆","readings":[{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72162","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}},{"text":"종업원이","meaning":"员工","explanation":"종업원：员工；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"종업원","audio":"/audio/de0065d4ed04b417c301.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91757","senseId":"1","lemma":"종업원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종업원이","audio":"/audio/8282bcfc0f3e8a4e0360.mp3"}},{"text":"바뀌었네요.","meaning":"被换，被更换，被调换","explanation":"바뀌다：被换，被更换，被调换；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"1","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바뀌었네요","audio":"/audio/67d2d0bc0bfd76750c9c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"53cc9fb21b3694bf","term":"카페","zh":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3","entryId":"72162","definition":"主要销售咖啡、茶、点心等的店铺。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"de0065d4ed04b417","term":"종업원","zh":"员工","audio":"/audio/de0065d4ed04b417c301.mp3","entryId":"91757","definition":"在职场等地从事某种业务的人。","pronunciation":["종어붠"]},{"id":"5207e639323d4244","term":"바뀌다","zh":"被换，被更换，被调换","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3","entryId":"61179","definition":"原有的东西被其他东西替代。","pronunciation":["바뀌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/900da05706a90a58a83f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61179-1-9-2","ko":"예전 종업원은 다른 곳에 취직이 되어서 나갔어요.","zh":"之前的员工去了别的地方工作，所以离开了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예전","meaning":"很久以前","explanation":"예전：很久以前","readings":[{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70090","senseId":"1","lemma":"예전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}},{"text":"종업원은","meaning":"员工","explanation":"종업원：员工；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"종업원","audio":"/audio/de0065d4ed04b417c301.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91757","senseId":"1","lemma":"종업원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종업원은","audio":"/audio/a4499c84288406bbdc3b.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"곳에","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","se